@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam linetype polyline
hide empty description

[*] --> NotSubmitted : the student has not done the activity
NotSubmitted --> Pending : the student did it
[*] --> Pending : decision planned
Pending --> Autograded : Autograder gave the grade
Pending --> GradedByTeacher : a teacher graded first
Pending --> Failed : the grading failed
Pending --> NotAutograded : the grading was cancelled
Failed --> NotAutograded : the reader cannot see failures
Autograded --> [*]
GradedByTeacher --> [*]
Failed --> [*]
NotAutograded --> [*]

note right of Failed
  The report only reads the status
  that Autograder recorded; it never
  changes it.
end note

@enduml
